H)ph.Datafax:                               V)RatioType(0/1/2): 0
I)ph.Celluar:                               W)          Ratio : 0
J)Password1 : ENCRYPTED                     X)DL Limit: 999999999
K)Password2 :                               Y)DL Today: 0
L)Fido PW   : 
M)time limit: 1660  N)time used: 10
O)Chat limit: 0     P)Chat used: 0          Computer: AMIGA
Callstoday: 0       Calls: 5175
[CTRL-C] quickconf,Select [A-Y],[ESC] quit, [TAB] next user,[~] save
